OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD hails big
OL,4,Avictory in east, but falls short of
OL,5,Amajority
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Alternative for Germany (AfD) has
OL,8,Fwon a decisive victory in Germany's
OL,9,Feastern state of Saxony-Anhalt, far
OL,10,Fahead of mainstream rivals. Preliminary
OL,11,Fresults show it has fallen short of an
OL,12,Foutright majority, but the AfD says it
OL,13,Fhas won a mandate to govern.
OL,15,FThe far-right AfD secured 43.8% of the
OL,16,Fvote, with the conservative CDU on
OL,17,F17.2%, according to the state election
OL,18,Fcommission's interim results.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
