OL,3,AGermany's far-right AfD hails big
OL,4,Avictory in east, but falls short of
OL,5,Amajority
OL,6,
OL,7,FCharismatic leader in the state, Ulrich
OL,8,FSiegmund, said it was "sensational" and
OL,9,Fthey wanted to start governing as soon
OL,10,Fas possible.
OL,12,FNo far-right party has won control of a
OL,13,FGerman state since World War Two, and
OL,14,Fgoverning at state level would mean
OL,15,Fpowers over policing, local education
OL,16,Fand culture.
